@host = http://localhost:8080

### Default page: 5 books sorted by title
GET {{host}}/api/books

### Second page, three books, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/books?page=1&size=3&sort=year,desc

### Filter the same collection
GET {{host}}/api/books?genre=TECHNOLOGY&page=0&size=3&sort=year,desc

### Invalid sort field: 400 ProblemDetail
GET {{host}}/api/books?sort=nosuchfield

### Missing resource: 404 ProblemDetail
GET {{host}}/api/books/999

### Create: 201 and Location (use that Location for the requests below)
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lab Eight Demo",
  "author": "Demo Author",
  "year": 2020,
  "genre": "SCIENCE",
  "available": true
}

### Repeat the preceding POST: 409 ProblemDetail

### Replace 9 with the identifier from Location
PUT {{host}}/api/books/9
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Lab Eight Demo",
  "author": "Demo Author",
  "year": 2021,
  "genre": "SCIENCE",
  "available": false
}

### Delete: 204; repeat: 404
DELETE {{host}}/api/books/9

### Validation failure: 400 and errors.title
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"","author":"Demo Author","year":2020,"genre":"SCIENCE"}

### OpenAPI specification
GET {{host}}/v3/api-docs
